node_modules/
# Anchored on purpose. A bare `lib/` matches at **every** depth, which silently
# swallowed `scripts/lib/` — the directory holding `bundle.mjs`, the helper every
# gate script imports. A fresh clone then died at `import './lib/bundle.mjs'`.
# `/lib/` is the tsc output tree: untracked by design, rebuilt by `prepare`, and
# kept honest by `check:libsync`.
/lib/
.tmp/
# The lib-freshness gate compiles into this tree. It has to sit one level below the
# repository root (same depth as lib/) so tsc emits comparable sourcemap `sources`.
.tmp-libsync/
*.tsbuildinfo
.dsh-jev-gate/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
